# Entity shape

- Inherit `Entity` or `MutableEntity<TKey>`. `TKey` is the id type: `MutableEntity<Guid>`.
- `Entity.Id` is `Guid`. Private setters. Private parameterless ctor for EF (`#pragma warning disable CS8618` around it).
- Collections of entities: private `List<T>` + public `IReadOnlyCollection<T>` via `.AsReadOnly()`.
- Primitive id lists: `ICollection<T> { get; private set; } = []` so EF maps them without `HasField`.

```csharp
public class Page : MutableEntity<Guid>
{
    private Page() { }

    public DateTimeOffset DateAdded { get; private set; }

    private readonly List<PageStage> _stages = [];
    public IReadOnlyCollection<PageStage> Stages => _stages.AsReadOnly();
}
```
